.TH ORO-IROH 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:iroh \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:iroh'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
High\-level bindings for the native iroh runtime. Provides helpers to create endpoints, establish peer\-to\-peer connections, exchange datagrams, and work with unidirectional/bidirectional streams.
